WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.178
The screen is 160 pixels across, and 120 down.

2
00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:07.905
x counts across from the left edge.

3
00:00:08.157 --> 00:00:12.257
y counts down from the top edge, so a bigger y is lower.

4
00:00:12.509 --> 00:00:17.384
Zero zero is the top left corner. 80, 60 is the middle.
